  m_text: 'The ambient light (Lighting window, Environment, Environment Lighting) lights every surface from all around. It is the only light where no light reaches. Night is a low, coloured ambient, not a black one.


    <b>Predict:</b> Set Environment Lighting to Source Color, black. What disappears?


    <b>Try:</b> Make it night without adding lights. Set the Sun''s Intensity to 0. Create a material with the shader Skybox/Procedural, lower its Exposure and set it as the Skybox Material. Set the ambient to dark blue. Press Generate Lighting after each change.


    <size=85%><color=#A8A8A8>Reference: 17, 18</color></size>'
