  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Distance fog blends each pixel toward one colour by its distance from the camera (Lighting window, Environment, Other Settings, Fog). It does not know where the lights are.


    <b>Predict:</b> Turn the fog on and leave the sky as it is. How will the slit wall and the horizon look against the sky?


    <b>Try:</b> Set the fog''s Color to the colour of the sky at the horizon, so the far end fades into the sky. Compare the Linear and Exponential modes.


    <size=85%><color=#A8A8A8>Reference: 16, 17</color></size>'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
