  m_text: 'A smooth surface shows a reflection of its surroundings. Where no Reflection Probe reaches, it reflects the sky (Lighting window, Environment, Environment Reflections). A Reflection Probe captures the view from its own position; surfaces inside its box reflect that capture.


    <b>Predict:</b> Look at the wet floor under the arches. What does it reflect?


    <b>Try:</b> Add a Reflection Probe (GameObject > Light > Reflection Probe). Set its Box Size to cover the arcade and press Bake. Then move the camera along the arcade with Box Projection off, and on.


    <size=85%><color=#A8A8A8>Reference: 17</color></size>'
